CM_ "GM Global B Super Cruise 1 physical CAN2 database. Unknown transmitters use Vector__XXX.";
CM_ BO_ 47 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries actual axle torque and a second axle-torque channel whose precise role is not yet identified.";
CM_ BO_ 50 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries estimated gear and shift-lever position.";
CM_ BO_ 58 "Transmitter: EPS. Received by ACP3_MCU; authenticated EPS data. The application fields other than the rolling counter are not yet identified.";
CM_ BO_ 59 "Transmitter: EBCM. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries brake-pedal position, brake torque, wheel-distance edge counters, and wheel angular velocities.";
CM_ BO_ 62 "Transmitter: BCM. Received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 63 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries nominal road-load axle torque.";
CM_ BO_ 66 "Transmitter: EBCM. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries driver-applied brake pressure. The field identity is supported by its scaling and correlation with brake-pedal position; the physical unit is not yet established.";
CM_ BO_ 72 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries primary electric transmission range and electronic-shift status.";
CM_ BO_ 84 "Transmitter: EPS. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries steering-wheel angle, angle gradient, calibration status, and validity state.";
CM_ BO_ 174 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 175 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 182 "Transmitter: CGM. Raw-forwarded by CGM to CAN2 from CAN4 0x209 or CAN8 0x0C0 and received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown. CGM route: raw CAN4 0x209 -> CAN2; raw CAN8 0x0C0 -> CAN2; network-to-CAN relay on CAN2.";
CM_ BO_ 186 "Transmitter: CGM. Generated from ACP3_SOC network data and received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown. CGM route: network-to-CAN relay on CAN2 from ACP3_SOC data.";
CM_ BO_ 192 "Transmitter: EBCM. Received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 226 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 545 "Received by ACP3_MCU; transmitter and application layout are unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 586 "Transmitter remains unresolved. Received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 597 "Transmitter: CGM. Raw-forwarded by CGM from CAN5 to CAN2 and received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown. CGM route: raw CAN5 0x255 -> CAN2.";
CM_ BO_ 610 "Transmitter: ECP_E. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries average non-driven vehicle speed.";
