CM_ BO_ 624 "Transmitter: EBCM. Received by ACP3_MCU; carries actual vehicle acceleration and the four wheel-direction states.";
CM_ BO_ 634 "Transmitter: BCM. Received by ACP3_MCU; application layout is unknown.";
